<Solution>
  <!-- Profile LocalIntegration: tests against locally hosted infrastructure (broker, database).
       Deliberately empty at the F1a checkpoint - F1a builds the foundation and migrates no
       behavioural cohort, so this profile has no member yet. It is created now so the profile
       boundary exists and is evaluable from the start rather than appearing with its first
       consumer. Running it while empty is expected to fail with the Microsoft Testing Platform's
       zero-test exit code 8; that failure is honest and must not be converted into success. -->
  <Folder Name="/tests2/" />
</Solution>
